{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t04.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t04.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t04_01",
      "hash64": "916BCBBC289694FB",
      "text": "這裡是深缽鎮。\\n是充滿花草與藝術的城鎮！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t04_09",
      "hash64": "916BC3BC28968763",
      "text": "向日花怪的表情看起來好惆悵！\\n作者是在什麼樣的心情下創作的呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t04_12",
      "hash64": "916F4EBC2899A96B",
      "text": "我和女友約在\\n奇怪的擺設前面會合！\\r\\n但是她一直還沒出現！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t04_26",
      "hash64": "9172D0BC289CBC28",
      "text": "我和男友約在\\n奇怪的擺設前面會合，\\r\\n但這個城鎮奇怪的擺設實在太多了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t04_31",
      "hash64": "91763BBC289FA7D0",
      "text": "深缽知名景點――迷宮遊戲場！\\n快來挑戰看看喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t04_36",
      "hash64": "917642BC289FB3B5",
      "text": "到了春天的時候，\\n向日種子就會乘風飛來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t04_58",
      "hash64": "917CD0BC28A510AD",
      "text": "哎呀～\\n這個作品的概念是強調對比啊。\\r\\n我想外行人一定看不出來吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t04_64",
      "hash64": "918052BC28A8236A",
      "text": "我是來欣賞這個知名作品的！\\n雖然我看不出個所以然，但真厲害啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t04_65",
      "hash64": "918053BC28A8251D",
      "text": "又是一條死路……\\n嗚，我迷路了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t04_69",
      "hash64": "918047BC28A810B9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳竟然能來到這裡，\\n算是有本事！\\c\\n沒有任何人能到得了這個地方，\\n所以我把這裡當作秘密基地！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t04_74",
      "hash64": "9183D0BC28AB2F5B",
      "text": "要是累了，\\n就稍微停下腳步看看……\\r\\n如此一來，也會有一些新的發現吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t04_76",
      "hash64": "9183D2BC28AB32C1",
      "text": "我真不敢相信向日種子進化之後，\\n竟然會變成向日花怪。\\r\\n進化真是太～神奇了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t04_105",
      "hash64": "B9D313B8FD20C76C",
      "text": "我的坐騎寶可夢很酷吧～！\\c\\n我正和這傢伙一起到\\n很多不同的地方旅行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t04_115",
      "hash64": "B9CFA7B8FD1DDA11",
      "text": "這就是寇沙大師的作品啊！\\n但風格似乎有些不太一樣……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t04_118",
      "hash64": "B9CFA2B8FD1DD192",
      "text": "我最喜歡高高的地方了～！\\c\\n聽說鎮外有個叫做瞭望台的地方，\\n那裡就像是座高塔一樣喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
